  "clean_text": "Driving Away Darkness | Sankara Driving Away Darkness | Sankara About Services Social Impact Donate Pledge Your Eyes Education Careers Our Blog Contact Services About Us About Pledge Your Eyes Contact Education Social Impact Services Donate Awards Dr.RVR Awards and Biography lasikblr Sankara Lasik Services OUR STORY SERVICES SOCIAL IMPACT Driving Away Darkness 1 MIN READ January 25, 2018 Driving Away Darkness Babu, 53, is a former lorry driver who had been driving for more than 30 years. He was left suddenly out of work when his vision began to fail. He had blurred vision and was found to have cataract in both eyes. The cost of cataract surgery loomed large before him, but he was guided towards Sankara’s free surgery by one of his acquaintances who knew one of our field workers. After deciding to go ahead with surgery, he hasn’t looked back ever since! He resumed his job as a bus driver in a private college, and is happy to be able to drive again. He looks forward to playing with his grandchildren soon. Recent Posts Best squint eye treatment and surgery hospital in India Lasik Eye Surgery Cost in India Eye Doctor in Ludhiana – Complete Guide follow us on social OUR STORY SERVICES SOCIAL IMPACT EDUCATION DONATE OUR PUBLICATIONS PLEDGE YOUR EYES CAREERS CONTACT US PRIVACY POLICY Unit of Sri.Kanchi Kamakoti Medical Trust Copyright 2023 sankaraeye.com Baked & Frosted by Misfit Inc"
